,"South can now turn his attention to hearts and lead that suit to force out the @HA. "],["pg",""],["ls","shwh"],["pc","hkhahh"],["pg",""],["hs","ssws"],["at","West can do no better than return a spade to South, "],["pg",""],["ls","wsss"],["pc","sjsssa"],["pg",""],["hs","sh"],["at","but South has won 6 tricks at this point and his 3 heart winners will be enough to secure the contract."],["",""]]}}